data: {"id": "bb1fc384ddc74313-thinking-parallel_evidence-1298", "run_id": "bb1fc384ddc74313", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 仍然存在**：`kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-11 -o yaml` 返回真实对象，deletionTimestamp=2026-09-07T23:09:46Z，距今 54 分钟以上，**确认为 TerminatingStuck**（非 NotFound）。\n- **Finalizer 卡死根因**：`metadata.finalizers: [\"aiops.lab/hold\"]` —— Pod 被自定义 finalizer `aiops.lab/hold` 锁定，kubelet 的 Killing 事件（54m 前）已发出，但 finalizer 未释放，导致 Pod 对象无法从 API Server 删除。这是 TerminatingStuck 的直接原因。\n- **容器实际已终止**：容器 `app` 的 State=Terminated, Exit Code=137 (SIGKILL), Started=23:09:43, Finished=23:09:57。容器在 deletionTimest", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788825849627, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

